OL,3,GNEWSAHuge fly-tip grew undetected over 
OL,4,Aseveral months                         
OL,6,FTwo fly-tippers were able to dump huge 
OL,7,Famounts of household waste over their  
OL,8,Fgarden fences without being detected   
OL,9,Ffor several months, with the pile      
OL,10,Feventually reaching 20 tonnes.         
OL,12,FIt was spotted on land owned by a      
OL,13,Fbusiness in South Wigston,             
OL,14,FLeicestershire, earlier in the year.   
OL,16,FHowever, due to the location of the    
OL,17,Ffly-tip, it was not immediately visible
OL,18,Fto employees of the business, which    
OL,19,FOadby and Wigston Borough Council said 
OL,20,F"allowed the offenders to act over     
OL,21,Fseveral months".                       
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
