OL,3,GNEWSAHuge fly-tip grew undetected over 
OL,4,Aseveral months                         
OL,6,FThe two individuals responsible were   
OL,7,Feach issued with a #600 fixed penalty  
OL,8,Fnotice following an interview under    
OL,9,Fcaution, the authority added, while a  
OL,10,Fthird person was cautioned for their   
OL,11,Frole in the offence.                   
